{
  "comment": "The cross-language parity gate (docs/design/v1-python.md §5). Each scenario is one offline invocation: argv, environment, and recorded responses. The TypeScript stage 1 generated tests/golden/<name>.txt and exit-codes.json from this file; the Python port must reproduce both byte for byte.",
